    "Name": "Washington MBT",
    "Details": "Created for the Terran Hegemony and the Star League Defence Force in 2605, the Washington MBT is a 45 ton tank designed to emphasis firepower and armor over speed or other features. With a top speed of 65 kph, the Washinton has 9 tons of Ferro-Fibrous armor and is armed with an LB-10X AC. A pair of Medium Pulse Lasers serve as backup weapons.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 4/6 hexes / 120/180 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       200     25\n<b>Left</b>         160     25\n<b>Right</b>       160     25\n<b>Rear</b>        125     25\n<b>Turret</b>      160     25\n\n<b>Total</b>      805    125</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Main Battle Tank</color>",
